<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" ?>
<Defs>
  <!--
    The resurrect mech ability's resolve effect, triggered once where the corpse lay as the
    mech stands up (the centerEffecterDef of AbilityDefs/ResurrectMech.xml, played by
    OverlordWarcasket.Ability_ResurrectMech.Cast). Biotech's ApocrionAoeResolve (sic, 1.7.4990,
    Biotech Defs/Effects/Effecter_Misc.xml) sized for one mech, as OLWC_ResurrectWarmup is and
    for the same reason: the apocriton's bursts 15 sparks across its 5 cell area under a flash
    that grows past 6 cells, around every mech the cast raised.

    - The sparks: burstCount 6 within positionRadius 1.5, the half width of the largest mech
      body, against 15 within 5. A ninth of the area would take two sparks at the apocriton's
      density, which reads as nothing happening; six is a burst on the mech itself.
    - The flash is OLWC_ResurrectFlash (Effects/ResurrectFlash.xml), the apocriton's with half
      its growth.
    The glow on the mech itself is Biotech's MechResurrected, the ability's appliedEffecterDef,
    which is per mech already.
  -->
  <EffecterDef>
    <defName>OLWC_ResurrectResolve</defName>
    <children>
      <li>
        <subEffecterClass>SubEffecter_SprayerTriggered</subEffecterClass>
        <moteDef>Mote_MechSparkSimple</moteDef>
        <burstCount>6</burstCount>
        <rotation>-150~-150</rotation>
        <spawnLocType>OnTarget</spawnLocType>
        <scale>1.0~1.3</scale>
        <positionRadius>1.5</positionRadius>
      </li>
      <li>
        <subEffecterClass>SubEffecter_SprayerTriggered</subEffecterClass>
        <fleckDef>OLWC_ResurrectFlash</fleckDef>
        <burstCount>1</burstCount>
        <spawnLocType>OnSource</spawnLocType>
      </li>
    </children>
  </EffecterDef>
</Defs>
